# Manuscript build products (regenerate with analysis/build_manuscript.py,
# analysis/gait120_figures.py and the manuscript/make_*.py scripts)
manuscript/main.pdf
manuscript/*.zip
manuscript/*.docx

# Generated artifacts, not sources. The paper itself, its figures and the
# packaged bundles are produced by the generators below and are not tracked.
manuscript/main.tex
manuscript/figures/
manuscript/*.pdf
manuscript/*.zip
manuscript/*.docx
manuscript/*.aux
manuscript/*.log
manuscript/*.bbl
manuscript/*.blg
manuscript/*.out

# The generators themselves are tracked. They are the machinery that turns the
# experiment into the reported tables, figures, statistics and archive, so
# losing them would lose the record of how the results were produced. Machine
# paths come from EMG_TST_RUNS and EMG_TST_ARTIFACTS, not from these files.
